WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.748
This paper introduces DGAPN, the Distilled Graph
Attention Policy Network,

00:00:04.828 --> 00:00:11.141
a reinforcement learning framework for generating
drug-like molecules that bind antiviral targets.

00:00:11.221 --> 00:00:15.838
It combines spatial graph attention encoding
chemistry and 3D structure,

00:00:15.918 --> 00:00:18.186
a fragment-based attentional policy,

00:00:18.266 --> 00:00:21.774
and a curiosity bonus from random network distillation,

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:24.710
beating prior generators on binding affinity.
